WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.580
You can add a passkey after creating your account. Open your account menu, then My account.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.685
Scroll to Passkeys. Give it a name, then choose Add a passkey.

00:00:10.185 --> 00:00:17.593
Follow your device or password manager’s prompt. Confirm with your fingerprint, face, device pin, or security key.

00:00:18.093 --> 00:00:21.586
Your passkey is saved. Open your account menu and sign out.

00:00:22.086 --> 00:00:27.758
Choose Sign in with a passkey. Confirm with your device or password manager, and you’re signed in.

00:00:28.258 --> 00:00:33.349
To remove one, return to My account. Choose Remove beside its name, then confirm.

00:00:33.849 --> 00:00:40.002
Your password and Google sign-in still work. If setup asks for a recent sign-in, sign in again first.
